- Use programme_market as the key to BeneluxLoyaltySchemeLookup. The posting day means the calendar-date portion of haulage_scan_time.
- Treat cross_border_move as false when it is null.
- For the EXCLUDED_DESTINATION test, compare dropoff_postcode against each string in the lookup field excluded_destination_prefixes; an absent or empty prefix list has no match. Route-result precedence is ROUTE_DETAILS_MISSING before EXCLUDED_DESTINATION before ACCEPTED.
- Only ACCEPTED routes may earn points. Convert the calculated decimal points amount to a long by retaining its whole-number portion.
- The priority earning rule is `(booked_product is PRIORITY) OR (cross_border_move is true AND chargeable_tonnes <= 2)`. Route eligibility overrides this result: a non-ACCEPTED route is always INELIGIBLE.

