Business logic:
- Missing CitizenRegistry or SocialAssistanceScheme produces REVIEW with zero amounts; reasons are CITIZEN_RECORD_NOT_FOUND then SCHEME_NOT_FOUND.
- Otherwise, produce REVIEW with INELIGIBLE_OR_INCOMPLETE when identity_verification_state is not VERIFIED, or annual_household_income is null, or annual_household_income exceeds income_ceiling_rupees, or when biometric_confirmation_required is true and biometric_confirmed is false.
- A PaymentChannel is usable only when its row exists, application_date is on or after channel_valid_from, and application_date is on or before channel_valid_to when channel_valid_to is not null. An unusable channel produces REVIEW with PAYMENT_CHANNEL_UNAVAILABLE.
- Otherwise, sanctioned_rupees is base_assistance_rupees plus dependant_allowance_rupees multiplied by eligible_dependant_count, but must not exceed requested_rupees. transfer_charge_rupees is sanctioned_rupees multiplied by transfer_charge_pct divided by 100. net_disbursement_rupees is sanctioned_rupees minus transfer_charge_rupees. Round each amount to two decimals and set payment_decision APPROVED with a null decision_reason.

